graph TB
    subgraph slam_toolbox架构
        A[输入 /scan + /odom + /tf]

        subgraph 预处理
            B[Scan 过滤 min/max laser range]
            C[Scan 降采样 throttle_scans]
            D[Scan 重心化 use_scan_barycenter]
        end

        subgraph 前端扫描匹配
            E[Scan-to-Scan 匹配 相邻帧 ICP]
            F[Scan-to-Submap 匹配 精细配准]
            G[Ceres Solver 非线性优化]
        end

        subgraph 后端图优化
            H[位姿图 Pose Graph]
            I[回环检测 Loop Closure]
            J[全局优化 g2o/Ceres]
        end

        subgraph 输出
            K[/map OccupancyGrid]
            L[/tf odom map]
            M[地图序列化]
        end

        A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G --> H --> I --> J --> K
        G --> H
        I --> J
        J --> L
        J --> M
    end

    style A fill:#e3f2fd
    style B fill:#fff3e0
